AUDIO: 'fast workflow generation. Now, basically what it does is very similar to the normal generation workflows that you have right there. The text to video, image to video, and references to video,'

[01:40] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'except that what it does is first generate your video at a very very low resolution like 0.2 megapixel which only takes like a few seconds. And then it uses a latent upscaler to upscale that'

